{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DrvWUmvQDk32jrnVYEZnzZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{操作手册与工具参考}\n2\t\n3\t\\subsection{Reward Learning Action Timeline}\n4\t\n5\t\\begin{table}[H]\n6\t\\centering\n7\t\\begin{tabular}{p{0.25\\textwidth} p{0.45\\textwidth} p{0.2\\textwidth}}\n8\t\\toprule\n9\t阶段 & 主要活动 & 负责人 \\\\\n10\t\\midrule\n11\t数据准备 & 采集 positive/negative 示例、偏好比较 & Data engineer + labelers \\\\\n12\tReward training & 训练 classifier/RLM、监控 loss 曲线 & ML engineer \\\\\n13\tEvaluation & 自动指标、human eval、safety probe & Ops + safety reviewer \\\\\n14\tDeployment & KL penalty tuning、logging + rollback & DevOps \\\\\n15\t\\bottomrule\n16\t\\end{tabular}\n17\t\\caption{Reward learning 的操作时间线}\n18\t\\end{table}\n19\t\n20\t\\subsection{工具与命令}\n21\t\n22\t\\begin{itemize}\n23\t    \\item 使用 `tensorboard` 监控 reward model 的 logits + loss\n24\t    \\item 将 `reward_score` 写入 experiment tracker（Weights & Biases / Neptune）\n25\t    \\item RLHF pipeline 推荐用 `trl` + `DPO` + `PPO` mix\n26\t\\end{itemize}\n27\t\n28\t\\begin{knowledgebox}{资源定位}\n29\t\\textbf{Reward learning 资料}集中在：OpenAI blog、Anthropic interpretability notes、Stanford RL lab releases。保持订阅这些更新可以及时调整 payoff curve。\n30\t\\end{knowledgebox}\n31\t\n32\t\\begin{figure}[H]\n33\t\\centering\n34\t\\includegraphics[width=0.92\\textwidth,page=7]{08_cs224r_reward_learning_2025.pdf}\n35\t\\caption{Reward trace dashboard 例示（lecture slide, page 7）}\n36\t\\end{figure}\n37\t\n38\t\\subsection{本章小结}\n39\t\n40\t操作手册强调每一步需要负责人并行推进，尤其是 reward training 与 evaluation 不能脱钩。\n41\t\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81a17524-87b5-5e9d-997b-0732e892d302","uuid":"94f558fb-b04c-42b7-9f44-6accb5203b1a","timestamp":"2026-09-27T07:02:37.267Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/ai-course-notes/.claude/workbench/translation/cs224r/chunks/cs224r__lecture08__lecture08-notes/007.zh.tex","content":"\\section{操作手册与工具参考}\n\n\\subsection{Reward Learning Action Timeline}\n\n\\begin{table}[H]\n\\centering\n\\begin{tabular}{p{0.25\\textwidth} p{0.45\\textwidth} p{0.2\\textwidth}}\n\\toprule\n阶段 & 主要活动 & 负责人 \\\\\n\\midrule\n数据准备 & 采集 positive/negative 示例、偏好比较 & Data engineer + labelers \\\\\nReward training & 训练 classifier/RLM、监控 loss 曲线 & ML engineer \\\\\nEvaluation & 自动指标、human eval、safety probe & Ops + safety reviewer \\\\\nDeployment & KL penalty tuning、logging + rollback & DevOps \\\\\n\\bottomrule\n\\end{tabular}\n\\caption{Reward learning 的操作时间线}\n\\end{table}\n\n\\subsection{工具与命令}\n\n\\begin{itemize}\n    \\item 使用 `tensorboard` 监控 reward model 的 logits + loss\n    \\item 将 `reward_score` 写入 experiment tracker（Weights & Biases / Neptune）\n    \\item RLHF pipeline 推荐用 `trl` + `DPO` + `PPO` mix\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\begin{knowledgebox}{资源定位}\n\\textbf{Reward learning 资料}集中在：OpenAI blog、Anthropic interpretability notes、Stanford RL lab releases。保持订阅这些更新可以及时调整 payoff curve。\n\\end{knowledgebox}\n\n\\begin{figure}[H]\n\\centering\n\\includegraphics[width=0.92\\textwidth,page=7]{08_cs224r_reward_learning_2025.pdf}\n\\caption{Reward trace dashboard 例示（lecture slide, page 7）}\n\\end{figure}\n\n\\subsection{本章小结}\n\n操作手册强调每一步需要负责人并行推进，尤其是 reward training 与 evaluation 不能脱钩。\n\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
